{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S08–S12 的短时段里仍堆叠了不少未标时感受，纵向扫读不如 X 轻松，容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用加亮的关键词让人物每一阶段的核心心理更容易被抓住，尤其是 S04 对美好回忆与旧委屈的联系、S09 对舍不得亲近与害怕孤单的区分，以及 S12 不再逼自己选边的转变，都比 X 更清楚。Y 的感受也更贴近音乐的具体变化，有声音、节奏、身体反应和心理波动之间的细腻对应，前后反复出现的亲近、失落、挣扎和重新站稳形成了更完整的过程。X 的双栏结构确实更容易快速浏览，但整体而言，Y 更能让我理解人物、跟住情绪，并感受到音乐与人物经历之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b6b6331-fa4c-41cc-b2f0-156fe246b057", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T163430852587Z", "elapsed_seconds": 126.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:36:36.930055+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a811bc9a60c6f15943596a440f8e69d4fa2554a5dc2004b5a35cb2cceacb1285", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4